{"v":4,"catch":"幫助波波母雞救回她的小雞。一步一步地走，小心你的路線。","desc":"這是一個極簡主義的益智遊戲，在行動之前你必須三思，一個錯誤的舉動可能會讓「咕咕」小雞走丟！她知道農場上沒有危險，但事物總是會變換位置，讓她感到困惑。\n\n你的目標是拯救迷失的小雞，將它們帶到舒適的穀倉，那裡有一個溫馨的雞舍供每個人使用，還有一位關愛有加的母親。","publisher":"Nejcraft","release":"2023-11-16","genres":["策略","益智","冒險","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2ce1a36734f200e2ddf9c0aab17792525172bbc01e234620b4f8b287f7915326.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/192f7839e94f642a4c85fd37351ebfbd893616157d2b155bc10373db1c8798d2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/abf96cf6c3b2a3b1017c4242c92a771641bf3a3dafb4df0f0c06b4a5286c1725.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0acdb4371d876e939c7617ec636880009ecb028ac2e6d5a491ae2b9adaa54b37.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/78bab1cee03ba578c2a3952a62cb90aa2c60059769538ecfb50adae9fca75dad.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/dc79dbdfaa98126bfd121d4bb39de5bf6559ec0224b804d0c991ca37ee36168f.jpg"],"titleId":"010034001d5a4000","dlc":[]}